345
00:29:24,564 --> 00:29:24,944
Hı hı.

346
00:29:24,944 --> 00:29:38,784
Evet.

347
00:29:30,132 --> 00:29:30,812
Tamam hocam.

348
00:29:31,471 --> 00:29:31,912
Tamam.

349
00:29:32,912 --> 00:29:35,132
